{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!\n佐藤詩織です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つ、い、に!!!!\n新しいこと始めちゃいました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラーー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"、、、、て言いましたが、\n実はもう、カメラは少し前から始めてるんです。\n一眼レフをちょうど一年前くらいに始めまして、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中で、一眼レフで撮っていく中で芽生えたきもち。\n”もっと昔みたいな 味のある写真が撮りたい”"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"……そう。\nそう思い立ってしまって、つ、い、に!!\n新しいこと始めましたーー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その名も、フィルムカメラーー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィルムを入れて撮る、ちょっと昔のカメラです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街ブラして、沢山撮りました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん!↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN47JH0AVJE6003NB8S0SDH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nあたたかい愛のかたち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN47KKE5JYGFA06SPX11J3Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n陽を浴びて 光り輝く紅。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN47NT48RRRNKPVW7M564C5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n新しい命に向かって陽を浴びる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN47QNTWA00G283AE5ASRC7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nいつまでも元気で、長生きしてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN47S8QQX71R3CADYA8N8Z6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n暑い夏が来そうな 知らせ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ沢山撮ったから、またあしたも載せます!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見に来てください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあああああ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい楽しみ、好きなことに出会ったときのこの胸のざわざわ感!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高やあああああああああああああ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィルムカメラ、今日より、ハマりそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詩織**"}],"source":"archive"}